Data licence
============

data/hts.csv, data/hts.json, data/additional_duties.csv
  Derived from the US Harmonized Tariff Schedule published by the U.S. International Trade
  Commission. Works of the US government are in the public domain (17 U.S.C. 105). To the extent
  any rights exist in this compilation, they are waived under CC0 1.0 Universal:
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

data/eu_duty_by_origin.csv, data/eu_duty_by_country.csv
  Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0
  (EU Common Customs Tariff and TARIC measures, published through the UK Trade Tariff XI service):
  https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

Maintained by CheckDutyRates — https://checkdutyrates.com/
